290 0 obj
  << /ActualText (FigJam is a whiteboard collaboration tool you and your team can use to brainstorm and organize ideas\056 You don\047t need to have any prior knowledge of design tools to get jamming\056\n\nFigJam files are lightweight\054 inclusive environments where anyone can take part\056 Think of them as digital whiteboards where you and your team discover and explore ideas\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 291 0 R
     /Pg 284 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
