294 0 obj
  << /ActualText (How to collaborate\n\nFigJam is better with friends\056 You can access collaborative tools via the      menu in the toolbar\056 \n\nClick Share to open the share modal for that file\056 Invite collaborators\054 copy a link to the file\054 or update the file\047s link sharing settings\056\n\nView the avatars of anyone currently active in the file\056 Click someone\047s avatar to observe their actions in the file\056\n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 295 0 R
     /Pg 284 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

