296 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Connected Designs\n\nFigJam and Figma live side\055by\055side\054 so all design work\054 from ideation to execution\054 can be found in one place\056\n\nYou can only create components in Figma design\056 Once created\054 they can be accessed and used in both FigJam and Figma design files\056\n\n)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 297 0 R
     /Pg 284 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

